        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gregg Rolie, Rob Tyner\n- Roles: singer, keyboardist, musician, lead singer\n- Places: Seattle, Washington, United States, Detroit\n- Organizations: MC5\n- Topics: American music\n\nFacts:\n- Gregg Rolie was born on June 17, 1947, in Seattle, Washington, United States.\n- Rob Tyner was born as Robert W. Derminer on December 12, 1944, and later became known professionally as Rob Tyner.\n- Gregg Rolie is an American singer and keyboardist.\n- Rob Tyner was an American musician best known as the lead singer for the Detroit proto-punk band MC5.\n- Rob Tyner died on September 18, 1991.",
